Line 32: Escaped '%' in line: abstract = {This is a Fortran 90 test program package of "qlog1p", "dlog1p", and "slog1p", the quadruple, double, and single precision programs to compute a special logarithm function, log1p(x) = log(1+x), accurately by mini-max rational approximations. "qlog1p", "dlog1p", and "slog1p" keep 33, 16, and 9 digit accuracy for arbitrary value of x, especially even when |x| is small. They are fast in the sense that "dlog1p" and "slog1p" run 20\\\% and 30\\\% faster than "dlog(x)" in the standard math library, respectively, while "qlog1p" runs 9 times slower than "qlog(x)".},
